      "origin": "http://localhost:3302",
      "servedFrom": "wt/morphing-modal-dialog"
    }
  },
  "caveats": [
    "The accessible name after the fix is the component's default, \"Dialog\": the demo does not pass the new ariaLabel prop.",
    "Before the fix the modal cannot be closed with the keyboard at all, so the \"before\" runs close with the demo's own ✕ control. That control unmounts with the panel, which is part of why focus ends on <body>."
